    "excerpt": "<em>Gebetbuch für israelitische Soldaten im Kriege</em> (1914) was translated and arranged by Rabbi Dr. Max Grunwald for Jewish military personnel in the Austro-Hungarian Armed Forces in service to Kaiser Franz Joseph Ⅰ (1830-1916) during what became known as World War Ⅰ. ",
